<section class="section bordered tk-journey-section"><div class="tk-shell"><div class="section-copy journey-copy reveal"><div class="kicker">EVERY CUSTOMER HAS A STORY. NOW YOU CAN SEE IT.</div><h2>See every <em>customer journey.</em></h2><p>Most platforms show isolated clicks, orders, and conversions. TraceKit connects the events behind each customer—from the first ad interaction through checkout, purchases, upsells, subscriptions, refunds, and chargebacks.</p><p>See which marketing sources brought customers in, what revenue they generated, and where profit was gained or lost. Explore traceable source evidence, with missing or unresolved information clearly identified.</p><p class="tk-journey-instruction">Select any event to inspect its example evidence.</p></div>
